cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "bjd: convert observation times in a CSV or FITS table to BJD_TDB"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/bjd"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/bjd"
abstract: >-
  Batch-converts a column of observation times in a CSV or FITS table to
  BJD_TDB (barycentric Julian date, TDB). The input format and time scale
  must be stated explicitly; the tool refuses to guess either.
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - barycentric Julian date
  - exoplanet
  - time conversion
